 titanic:{special:['A shipboard Sunday service is drawing passengers from several parts of the vessel.','A formal dinner has changed the rhythm of the evening promenade.','Passengers are gathering around posted notices and newly delivered messages.'],home:['Your cabin or shared room feels unusually still between public activities. Clothes must be brushed, belongings organized, and letters finished before the next meal.','A steward passes while you straighten a berth, fold a coat, and decide whether to write home or go upstairs for air.']},
